## Error Title
Authentication Failure
 
---
 
## Error ID
KE-AUTH-001
 
---
 
## Error Description
401 Unauthorized
 
---
 
## Root Cause
Credentials are expired, invalid, or incorrectly configured.
 
---
 
## Resolution
- Refresh authentication tokens.
- Verify usernames, passwords, and secrets.
- Confirm token expiration settings.
- Reconfigure credentials if necessary.
 
